                                "sense_id": "4a494fc9-6882-3d23-9f7c-fcf75515bd66",
                                "text": "1779–81, Samuel Johnson, \"Samuel Garth\" in Lives of the Most Eminent English Poet\nThe college of physicians, in July, 1687, published an edict, requiring all the fellows, candidates, and licentiates, to give gratuitous advice to the neighbouring poor."
